der Information</span> <span class="zmdi zmdi-chevron-right icon" aria-hidden=true></span> </button><div class="nav__sublist-wrap nav__sublist-wrap--tertiary js-nav-submenu js-nav-tertiary js-mobile-menu"><div class=nav__main-sublink-wrap><button class="nav__mobile-back-btn js-mobile-back-btn" type=button><span class="zmdi zmdi-chevron-left icon"></span><span>Back</span></button> <a href="/investors/shareholder-information/" class="nav__main-sublink js-nav-main-sublink">Shareholder Information<span class="zmdi zmdi-chevron-right icon" aria-hidden=true></span></a> <button class="nav__back-btn-wrap js-nav-back-btn" type=button> <span class=nav__back> <span class="zmdi zmdi-chevron-left icon"></span> <span>Back</span> </span> </button></div><ul class=nav__sublist><li class=nav__sublist-item><a href="/investors/shareholder-information/regulatory-news/" class=nav__sublink><span class=nav__sublink-text>Regulatory News</span></a><li class=nav__sublist-item><a href="/investors/shareholder-information/share-price-and-tools/" class=nav__sublink><span class=nav__sublink-text>Share Price &amp; Tools</span></a><li class=nav__sublist-item><a href="/investors/shareholder-information/dividends/" class=nav__sublink><span class=nav__sublink-text>Dividends</span></a><li class=nav__sublist-item><a href="/investors/shareholder-information/financial-calendar/" class=nav__sublink><span class=nav__sublink-text>Financial Calendar</span></a><li class=nav__sublist-item><a href="/investors/shareholder-information/equity-research/" class=nav__sublink><span class=nav__sublink-text>Equity Research</span></a></ul></div><li class=nav__sublist-item><a href="/investors/corporate-governance/" class=nav__sublink><span class=nav__sublink-text>Corporate Governance</span></a><li class=nav__sublist-item><a href="/investors/investor-contacts/" class=nav__sublink><span class=nav__sublink-text>Investor Contacts</span></a></ul></div></div></div></div><li class="nav__list-item js-nav-item" aria-haspopup=true><a href="/sustainability/" class="nav__link js-nav-link">Sustainability</a><li class=nav__bottom-wrap><div class=nav__bottom><div class=nav__share-price><div class=share-price><span class=share-price__text>LSE:</span> <a href="/investors/shareholder-information/share-price-and-tools/" class=share-price__link> <span class=share-price__price>235.00</span> <span class=share-price__currency>p</span> </a> <span class=share-price__time>17:20 BST</span></div></div><div class="nav__list-item js-nav-item" aria-haspopup=true><a href="/news-insights/" class="nav__link js-nav-link">News &amp; Insights</a></div><div class="nav__list-item js-nav-item" aria-haspopup=true><a href="/contacts/" class="nav__link js-nav-link">Contacts</a></div></div></ul></nav><div class=header__search><button class="header__search-btn radius-sm js-search-button" type=button><span class="zmdi zmdi-search icon" aria-hidden=true></span><span class=sr-only>Search Button</span></button><div class="search-popup js-search-popup"><div class=wrap><form class="search-popup__form js-search-form" action="/search/"><div class=search-popup__input-wrap><span class="search-popup__search-icon zmdi zmdi-search icon" aria-hidden=true></span> <label class="search-popup__label sr-only" for=search>Search</label> <input class="search-popup__input js-search-input-header" id=search name=term type=search placeholder=Search autocomplete=off> <button class="search-popup__reset js-search-reset" aria-label="Reset serach" type=button> <span class="zmdi zmdi-close icon" aria-hidden=true></span> </button></div><button class="search-popup__submit btn radius-sm"> <span class=search-popup__btn-text>Search</span> <span class="zmdi zmdi-search icon" aria-hidden=true></span> </button></form></div></div></div></div></div></div></header><main class=main id=main><div class="breadcrumbs breadcrumbs--left-align js-breadcrumbs" role=navigation aria-label="Breadcrumb navigation" data-script=breadcrumbs><div class=breadcrumbs__wrapper><ul class=breadcrumbs__list><li class=breadcrumbs__item><span class=breadcrumbs__link-wrap> <a class=breadcrumbs__link href="/" data-script=external-links>Home</a> <span class="zmdi zmdi-chevron-right icon" aria-hidden=true></span> </span><li class=breadcrumbs__item><span class=breadcrumbs__link-wrap> <a class=breadcrumbs__link href="/services/" data-script=external-links>Services</a> <span class="zmdi zmdi-chevron-right icon" aria-hidden=true></span> </span><li class=breadcrumbs__item><span class=breadcrumbs__link-wrap> <a class=breadcrumbs__link href="/services/securities/" data-script=external-links>Securities</a> <span class="zmdi zmdi-chevron-right icon" aria-hidden=true></span> </span><li class=breadcrumbs__item><span class="breadcrumbs__link-wrap breadcrumbs__link-wrap--active" aria-current=page>Dry FFA</span></ul></div></div><section class="global-banner global-banner--center-align section section--bg-secondary section--text-light"><picture class=global-banner__picture> <img loading=lazy class=global-banner__image src="/media/21jn2hcm/shutterstock_2099717761.webp?rxy=0.513531799729364,0.40052350507595147&amp;width=2688&amp;height=700&amp;v=1dcb552464e8910&amp;format=webp" alt=""> </picture><div class=global-banner__overlay style=opacity:50%;background-color:#000000 aria-hidden=true></div><div class="wrap wrap--narrow"><div class=global-banner__content><h1 class="global-banner__title headline h1">Dry FFA</h1><p class="global-banner__description body-text standfirst">Hedge freight exposure and access liquidity across Capesize, Panamax, Supramax & Handysize—futures and options, voice and screen.</div></div></section><section class="two-column section section--text-dark section--bg-white"><div class="spacer spacer--medium" aria-hidden=true></div><div class=wrap><div class=two-column__wrap><div class=two-column__left><h2 class="h3 headline">Fast Access to the FFA Market</h2></div><div class=two-column__right><div class=rte><div class="standfirst body-text"><p data-start=152 data-end=321>Our Dry FFA desk brokers freight derivatives that help market participants&nbsp;hedge risk, manage exposure and capture opportunities&nbsp;in the volatile&nbsp;dry-bulk&nbsp;sector.<p data-start=323 data-end=713>We are members of the Baltic Exchange and FFABA, with a strong presence across the freight-derivatives curve. Using BraemarScreen.com, we combine human insight with the speed of a digital interface, giving clients a seamless view of freight markets and direct access to liquidity.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="spacer spacer--medium" aria-hidden=true></div></section><div class="statistics statistics--center section section--bg-light section--text-dark"><div class="spacer spacer--medium" aria-hidden=true></div><div class=wrap><div class=statistics__wrapper><div class=statistics__text-content><h2 class="statistics__title headline h3">Our desk in numbers</h2><div class="statistics__description body-text standfirst"><p>A highly experienced team providing focused market intelligence, trusted execution and responsive support across the dry freight curve.</div></div><div class=statistics__items-wrap><div class=statistics__items><div class=statistics__item><img class=statistics__icon src=/media/b5jcbfak/vessel-status.svg alt=""><p class="statistics__statistic h2">2<div class="statistics__item-title headline h6"><p>Global hubs</div><div class="statistics__item-description body-text text"><p>London and Singapore</div></div><div class=statistics__item><img class=statistics__icon src=/media/gplouklf/team.svg alt=""><p class="statistics__statistic h2">10<div class="statistics__item-title headline h6"><p>Brokers</div><div class="statistics__item-description body-text text"><p>Specialists across the dry freight curve</div></div><div class=statistics__item><img class=statistics__icon src=/media/xz3hvlqd/dry-ffa-2.svg alt=""><p class="statistics__statistic h2">9<div class="statistics__item-title headline h6"><p>Products traded</div><div class="statistics__item-description body-text text"><p class=MsoNormal>C 5TC, C3, C5, C7, HS7TC, P 4TC, P 5TC, P6_82 and S 10TC</div></div><div class=statistics__item><img class=statistics__icon src=/media/3jbmw54k/contact.svg alt=""><p class="statistics__statistic h2">2<div class="statistics__item-title headline h6"><p>Operators</div><div class="statistics__item-description body-text text"><p>Post-trade support: matching, confirmation and reporting</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="spacer spacer--medium" aria-hidden=true></div></div><div class="proof-points proof-points--scrolled-overlap proof-points--scrolled-with-one-column proof-points--image section section--bg-white section--text-dark"><div class="spacer spacer--medium" aria-hidden=true></div><div class=wrap><div class=proof-points__wrapper><div class=proof-points__text-content><div class=proof-points__text-wrap><h2 class="proof-points__title headline h3">Our Services</h2></div></div><div class=proof-points__items-wrap><picture class="proof-points__image module-radius-md"><source media=(max-width:767px) srcset="/media/dlmmslyf/adobe-express-2025-10-14-162812.webp?width=328&amp;v=1dc3d1f401b1730&amp;format=webp"><img loading=lazy class="proof-points__img image" src="/media/dlmmslyf/adobe-express-2025-10-14-162812.webp?width=640&amp;v=1dc3d1f401b1730&amp;format=webp" alt=""> </picture><div class="proof-points__items proof-points__items--outlined proof-points__items--with-shadow js-proof-points-items" data-script=proof-points><div class="proof-points__item section section--bg-white section--text-dark module-radius-sm js-cta-card js-proof-points-card"><div class=proof-points__item-content><p class="proof-points__number headline h3">01<h4 class="proof-points__item-title headline h6">Full-spectrum Dry FFA coverage</h4><div class="proof-points__item-description body-text text rte"><div class="proof-points__item-description body-text text rte"><p class=MsoNormal>Capesize, Panamax, Supramax &amp; Handysize—futures and options.</div></div></div></div><div class="proof-points__item section section--bg-white section--text-dark module-radius-sm js-cta-card js-proof-points-card"><div class=proof-points__item-content><p class="proof-points__number headline h3">02<h4 class="proof-points__item-title headline h6">Tailored freight risk management</h4><div class="proof-points__item-description body-text text rte"><div class="proof-points__item-description body-text text rte"><p class=MsoNormal>Strategic hedging for owners, charterers, traders and financial institutions.</div></div></div></div><div class="proof-points__item section section--bg-white section--text-dark module-radius-sm js-cta-card js-proof-points-card"><div class=proof-points__item-content><p class="proof-points__number headline h3">03<h4 class="proof-points__item-title headline h6">Voice and screen execution</h4><div class="proof-points__item-description body-text text rte"><div class="proof-points__item-description body-text text rte"><p class=MsoNormal>Discreet, efficient broking supported by real-time market data and strong liquidity access.</div></div></div></div><div class="proof-points__item section section--bg-white section--text-dark module-radius-sm js-cta-card js-proof-points-card"><div class=proof-points__item-content><p class="proof-points__number headline h3">03<h4 class="proof-points__item-title headline h6">Regulatory and post-trade support</h4><div class="proof-points__item-description body-text text rte"><div class="proof-points__item-description body-text text rte"><p class=MsoNormal>Trade matching, confirmation, reporting and lifecycle management.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="spacer spacer--medium" aria-hidden=true></div></div><div class="proof-points proof-points--carousel proof-points--stacked-left-aligned cta-cards section section--bg-light section--text-alternate-dark"><div class="spacer spacer--small" aria-hidden=true></div><div class=wrap><div class=proof-points__wrapper><div class=proof-points__text-content><div class=proof-points__text-wrap><h2 class="proof-points__title headline h3">What Sets Us Apart</h2></div></div><div class=proof-points__items-wrap><div class="cta-cards__slider-wrap cta-cards__slider-wrap--carousel cta-cards__slider-wrap--mobile-carousel js-cards-carousel" data-script=cards-carousel><div class="cta-cards__slider splide" aria-label="Cards carousel"><div class="cta-cards__track splide__track"><ul class="cta-cards__list splide__list proof-points__items--outlined proof-points__items--with-shadow"><li class="cta-cards__slide splide__slide"><div class="proof-points__item section section--bg-white section--text-dark module-radius-sm js-cta-card js-proof-points-card"><div class=proof-points__item-content><img class=proof-points__icon src="/media/oi2ncyer/strategy.svg?width=60&amp;height=60&amp;v=1dcb8662bae7220" alt=""><h4 class="proof-points__item-title headline h6">Strategic Hedging Expertise</h4><div class="proof-points__item-description body-text text rte"><p style=mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto class=MsoNormal><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:'Aptos',sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:'Aptos',sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA">Our team works closely with shipowners, charterers, trading houses, and energy companies to develop optimal hedging strategies tailored to their unique exposure and operational goals.</span><br></span></div></div></div><li class="cta-cards__slide splide__slide"><div class="proof-points__item section section--bg-white section--text-dark module-radius-sm js-cta-card js-proof-points-card"><div class=proof-points__item-content><img class=proof-points__icon src="/media/xz3hvlqd/dry-ffa-2.svg?width=60&amp;height=60&amp;v=1dcb86628cada30" alt=""><h4 class="proof-points__item-title headline h6">Physical–Financial Synergy</h4><div class="proof-points__item-description body-text text rte"><p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:'Aptos',sans-serif">Backed by Braemar’s global shipping footprint, our broking desk benefits from close ties to the physical freight markets, promoting greater transparency, deeper market insight, and superior liquidity access.</span></div></div></div><li class="cta-cards__slide splide__slide"><div class="proof-points__item section section--bg-white section--text-dark module-radius-sm js-cta-card js-proof-points-card"><div class=proof-points__item-content><img class=proof-points__icon src="/media/tuldiefk/enlarge-2.svg?width=60&amp;height=60&amp;v=1dcb86628fd34d0" alt=""><h4 class="proof-points__item-title headline h6">Comprehensive Market Coverage</h4><div class="proof-points__item-description body-text text rte"><p><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:'Aptos',sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA">We broker across the full dry bulk curve, offering market intelligence and execution across Capesize, Panamax, Supramax, and Handysize routes.&nbsp;</span></div></div></div><li class="cta-cards__slide splide__slide"><div class="proof-points__item section section--bg-white section--text-dark module-radius-sm js-cta-card js-proof-points-card"><div class=proof-points__item-content><img class=proof-points__icon src="/media/rdhb0r4u/analysis-2.svg?width=60&amp;height=60&amp;v=1dcb86626daf110" alt=""><h4 class="proof-points__item-title headline h6">Data-Driven Insight</h4><div class="proof-points__item-description body-text text rte"><p><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:'Aptos',sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA">Supported by leading in-house research and proprietary market data, we offer clients informed, real-time pricing and a strategic view of freight market dynamics.</span></div></div></div><li class="cta-cards__slide splide__slide"><div class="proof-points__item section section--bg-white section--text-dark module-radius-sm js-cta-card js-proof-points-card"><div class=proof-points__item-content><img class=proof-points__icon src="/media/onxkqptn/teamwork.svg?width=60&amp;height=60&amp;v=1dcb8662bfe3fd0" alt=""><h4 class="proof-points__item-title headline h6">Adaptability & Service</h4><div class="proof-points__item-description body-text text rte"><p><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:'Aptos',sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA">Our dynamic team of brokers is built to respond to ever-changing market conditions, offering fast, flexible execution with discretion and integrity.</span></div></div></div></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="spacer spacer--small" aria-hidden=true></div></div><section class="zigzag section section--bg-light section--text-dark"><div class="spacer spacer--extra-small" aria-hidden=true></div><div class=wrap><div class=zigzag__wrapper><div class=zigzag__text-content><h2 class="zigzag__title headline h3">Braemar Screen</h2><div class="zigzag__description rte body-text text-large"><p>Braemar Screen provides access to live freight market prices, charting and market data. Users can create and execute orders, manage their order book and track trades in real time through a single interface.</div><div class=zigzag__links-wrap><a class="btn btn--lg btn--primary radius-sm" href="https://www.braemarscreen.com/" target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" data-script=external-links> <span class="zmdi icon icon--btn-left" aria-hidden=true></span> <span>Visit the site</span> <span class="zmdi icon icon--btn-right" aria-hidden=true></span> </a></div></div><div class=zigzag__media><div class=zigzag__media-wrap><picture class="zigzag__image module-radius-md"><source media=(max-width:767px) srcset="/media/f5nn0nyb/screenshot.webp?rxy=0.5,0.3882907133243607&amp;width=684&amp;height=390&amp;v=1dc2ee68f9366b0&amp;format=webp"><img loading=lazy class="picture__img image" src="/media/f5nn0nyb/screenshot.webp?rxy=0.5,0.3882907133243607&amp;width=869&amp;height=504&amp;v=1dc2ee68f9366b0&amp;format=webp" alt=""> </picture></div></div></div></div><div class="spacer spacer--medium" aria-hidden=true></div></section><div class="text-block section section--bg-light section--text-dark"><div class="spacer spacer--extra-small" aria-hidden=true></div><div class=wrap><div class=rte data-script=rte><p style=text-align:center;color:#6e6e6e><em>This is a financial promotion issued by Braemar Securities Limited, FRN: 583277, Capital at Risk</em></div></div><div class="spacer spacer--extra-small" aria-hidden=true></div></div><section class="cta-block cta-block--image section section--text-light"><div class="cta-block__holder section section--bg-secondary"><div class=wrap><div class=cta-block__wrapper><div class=cta-block__text-content><h2 class="cta-block__title headline h2">Contacts us</h2><div class="cta-block__description body-text standfirst">With deep integration between our physical shipping business and financial broking, we offer clients a seamless view of freight markets and direct access to market liquidity.</div><div class=cta-block__links-wrap><a class="btn btn--xxl btn--primary radius-sm" href="/contacts/dry-ffa/" data-script=external-links> <span class="zmdi icon icon--btn-left" aria-hidden=true></span> <span>Get in touch</span> <span class="zmdi icon icon--btn-right" aria-hidden=true></span> </a></div></div><div class=cta-block__media><div class=cta-block__media-wrap><picture class=cta-block__picture><source media=(max-width:767px) srcset="/media/uynb3bap/adam-mason-2.png?width=460&amp;height=308&amp;v=1dcc1c1d67c6e00&amp;format=webp"><img loading=lazy class=cta-block__image src="/media/uynb3bap/adam-mason-2.png?width=1165&amp;v=1dcc1c1d67c6e00&amp;format=webp" alt=""> </picture></div></div></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=footer><div class=footer__top><div class=wrap><div class=footer__top-wrap><div class=footer__overview><a class=footer__logo-holder href="/" aria-label="Home page link"> <img class=footer__logo src="/media/bdyfw1yz/braemar-logo-dark.png?format=webp" alt=""> </a><div class="footer__text rte"><p class=text-large>Built on experience.&nbsp;Driven by insight.</div></div><ul class="footer__col footer__nav" aria-label="Quick Links"><li class=footer__col-title>Quick Links<li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/"> Home </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/about-us/"> About Us </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/services/"> Services </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/investors/"> Investors </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/careers/"> Careers </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/sustainability/"> Sustainability </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/news-insights/"> News &amp; Insights </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/contacts/"> Contacts </a></ul><ul class="footer__col footer__tools" aria-label="Site Tools"><li class=footer__col-title>Site Tools<li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/sitemap/"> Sitemap </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/disclaimer/"> Disclaimer </a><li class=foot